# The guarded chain for 2.6.9 (nothing is pinned by this file alone: the pin is in dev/tests/guarded_chain.py, added after the marked commit). One diff per line, in landing order.
# Base: the 2.6.8 release (tag v2.6.8, 286b03c1); the guarded files on the trunk equal that release's.
# Guarded files only: system/scripts/live_server.py (G1, G2) and system/scripts/backup.py (bundle).
# Approved by Alan on 26-10-2026 ("approve the #382 and #371 diffs", "approve the bundle diff"); the bytes are frozen.
#
# G1 #382 (sha256 be27770da2b4dfcc95d66e7c1d605820f596525bbf2af78142c45b976273c9e3): the #365 follow-up. The check and load job runs start context-less
# (CONTEXTLESS_JOBS: an empty folder outside the vault, NO_CONTEXT_ARGS with the model named as sonnet, no session saved, no --add-dir; held mode's hook still
# passed); launch_context and run_dirs follow; KIND_PROMPTS for check and load say so; TRANSCRIPT_PROMPT step 1 searches one hour either side, then the
# whole day, then the exact start and end, never more than three searches, and takes only the event whose id is exactly the asked one.
dev/proposals/382/live_server-382.diff
# G2 #371 (sha256 3145004945ec7ae613629b42ad54ed50ad488a64ed70d54ba5037e324fbb37e2): on each run's init event one debug-log line (area run) with the count
# of MCP servers by status and the number of tools listed at start (init_summary: counts only, no names, no text).
dev/proposals/371/live_server-371.diff
# Bundle (sha256 c366014b52cdab015b3f6f4a03a99a1ffcb527bf5e1a17e5eef3007e2ff89659): backup.py's make_bundle no longer bundles history that holds
# system/staging, system/logs or system/branding: it makes one snapshot commit without them in a temporary repository (the vault's repository is only read,
# every GIT_* variable of the caller dropped), and keeps the plain --all bundle when no commit ever held those paths; the snapshot is shown in the manifest,
# the restore plan and the restore check (Health); verify_bundle and restore_git use the same environment.
dev/proposals/bundle/backup-bundle.diff
